\\ constants.6502 - the engine's constants, as the C has them.

CAM_RADIUS = 40                         ; the camera's circle, in units (camera.h)
POST_NEAR = 256                         ; d2 under this: on top of a post, left alone
POST_SCALE = 1.25*2^15                  ; a post's 1/d2: its quarter's overcorrection, and q15
